      "content": "i just called the doctor and they say they are closed until morning. i really dont want to deal with the ER if i dont have to. if i just give him a bunch of pedialyte or even some regular gatorade all at once he should be fine right? like can i just give him a whole bottle now to make sure he's good for the night? i just want him to wake up and be normal in the morning.",
